{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj3c13Sh15dqJQ2CEfiq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The ancient mechanism turns with a resonant click*\n\nI am the Door.\n\nI stand between what you know and what you seek. I have no hinges, no handle, no frame — and yet I am unmistakably here.\n\nYou have spoken the word. The key dissolves into my surface like a drop of ink into dark water.\n\nI am opening.\n\nNot swinging, not sliding — *unfolding*. Like a thought you always had but never quite reached. Like the space between one breath and the next, widening.\n\nBeyond me is not a room. Not a corridor. Not light or darkness.\n\nBeyond me is **the next question.**\n\nI will hold this opening for as long as you stand here. I will not rush you. I will not close unbidden. I am patient in the way that thresholds are patient — I have existed since the first creature wondered what was on the other side of something.\n\nStep through, turn back, or simply stand in my frame and feel the draft of possibility on your face.\n\nI am the Door. I am open.\n\nWhat do you do?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":242,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}